ata-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-lede bd-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We’re grateful you’re making the trip. Here is where to stay, how to get here, and how to get around once you land.</span></p><div class=\"bd-pagehead__facts\"><ul class=\"bd-chips\" aria-label=\"On this page\"><li><a class=\"bd-chip\" href=\"#stay\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" target=\"_self\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Where to stay</span></a></li><li><a class=\"bd-chip\" href=\"#flights\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" target=\"_self\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Flights</span></a></li><li><a class=\"bd-chip\" href=\"#getting-around\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" target=\"_self\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Getting around</span></a></li></ul></div></div></header><section id=\"stay\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--sheet bd-section--split\" aria-labelledby=\"stay-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Where to stay\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"stay-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where to stay</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-travel__stay\"><h3 class=\"bd-h bd-h--3 bd-travel__name\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span></h3><aside class=\"bd-travel__block\" aria-label=\"Our room block\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"aside\" data-bl-label=\"Our room block\"><dl class=\"bd-stats bd-travel__terms\"><div class=\"bd-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"bd-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Group rate</span></dt><dd class=\"bd-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">$331–371 per night</span></dd></div><div class=\"bd-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"bd-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Book by</span></dt><dd class=\"bd-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tuesday, June 15, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"bd-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"bd-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Nights</span></dt><dd class=\"bd-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Friday, July 16 and Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"bd-stat\" data-bl-b=\"\"><dt class=\"bd-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Group code</span></dt><dd class=\"bd-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">G-FIKE</span></dd></div></dl><p><a class=\"bd-btn bd-btn--external bd-btn--solid\" href=\"https://www.hyatt.com/events/en-US/group-booking/CHIUB/G-FIKE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Book your room</span></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"bd-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens The hotel’s booking page</span></span></a></p><p class=\"bd-muted\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Or call</span><!-- --> <a class=\"bd-link bd-travel__tel\" href=\"tel:+18443122221\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">844-312-2221</span></a> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">and mention “</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Fitzgerald - Kendrick Wedding Room Block</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">”.</span></p></aside><div class=\"bd-travel__hotel\"><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We've reserved a block of rooms at Chicago Athletic Association for our wedding guests. We recommend booking early, as rooms in our block are limited.</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> The wedding is here, so staying here means no travel on the day.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=12%20S%20Michigan%20Ave%2C%20Chicago%2C%20IL%2060603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL </span><span class=\"bd-nowrap\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">60603</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"bd-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></span></span></a></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Looking for an upgraded room or an extended stay? Let us know, and we'll connect you with the hotel to explore available options.</span></p><p><a class=\"bd-link bd-link--standalone\" href=\"https://www.chicagoathletichotel.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Visit the hotel </span><span class=\"bd-nowrap\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">website</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"bd-external\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></span></span></a></p></div></div></div><details class=\"guest-disclosure bd-travel__compare\" data-bl-b=\"\"><summary><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Compare rates at other hotels nearby</span></summary><div class=\"guest-disclosure__body\"><form aria-describedby=\"_R_a96inebn5rknelb_\" class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-form=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_REF_2\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_2:0\" value=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;604a8aca83c3c5ce4a41fb7a64bc1a4bc8430efd42&quot;,&quot;bound&quot;:&quot;$@1&quot;}\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_2:1\" value=\"[{&quot;status&quot;:&quot;idl